## Scenario

> You're a digital detective with the Nightwatch Investigations Agency tracking a mysterious criminal known as **"The Phantom"** who operates the **Digital Phoenix** marketplace in the neon-lit underworld. The Phantom has made critical OPSEC mistakes across multiple platforms, leaving digital breadcrumbs through dark web forums, technical discussion boards, professional networks, and corporate databases. Follow the shadows through rain-soaked digital alleyways to expose their true identity before they disappear into the night.

