## Flags & How They Were Found

### 🚩 Flag 1 — Forum Username
**`alex_phoenix_crypto`**

**Source:** CryptoTalk forum — the threat actor posted under this handle on Jan 15, 2022 in a thread titled *"New Anonymous Marketplace — Phoenix Rising"*, promoting `digitalphoenix.onion`.

> Also identified as `alex.martinez.crypto` in legacy posts — same persona, different era.

![CryptoTalk forum post showing username alex_phoenix_crypto]

---

### 🚩 Flag 2 — Leaked Email Address
**`a.martinez.crypto@protonmail.com`**

**Source:** Same CryptoTalk post (Jan 15, 2022). The actor publicly listed their contact email at the bottom of their forum post — a critical OPSEC failure that directly links the anonymous forum handle to a named identity:

```
For any serious inquiries about partnerships or development work,
contact: a.martinez.crypto@protonmail.com
```

The surname fragment `martinez` in the email directly corroborates the real name found later in the business registry.

---

### 🚩 Flag 3 — SSH Key Identifier
**`phoenix-key-2022`**

**Source:** TechHelp Q&A — the actor posted a technical support request that inadvertently included their SSH config file. The `IdentityFile` path contained the key label `phoenix-key-2022`, linking the technical infrastructure back to the same persona.

**Lesson:** SSH config leaks are a goldmine — they reveal hostnames, usernames, key paths, and jump hosts.

---

### 🚩 Flag 4 — Company Front
**`EBX TECHNOLOGIES LTD.`**

**Source:** LinkedOut profile for **Alex Martinez** — *"Senior Full-Stack Developer & Cybersecurity Consultant"*, Vancouver, BC. His experience section listed:

```
Founder — EBX Technologies • Vancouver, BC
2020 – Present
Blockchain integration and secure marketplace development
```

The "secure marketplace development" description and the 2020 founding date aligned precisely with when `digitalphoenix.onion` was being stood up.

---

### 🚩 Flag 5 — Real Full Name
**`Alejandro Nicolas Martinez`**

**Source:** Canadian Business Registry — searching for **EBX Technologies Ltd.** (Registration #: BC-2020-789123, incorporated March 15, 2020) revealed the Directors & Officers section, which listed:

```
MARTINEZ, ALEJANDRO NICOLAS
Position: Director
Date of Birth: October 19, 1992
```

"Alex Martinez" on LinkedOut was a shortened public alias for the same individual.

---

### 🚩 Flag 6 — Physical Address
**`1247 Phoenix Street Suite 301 Vancouver Canada`**

**Source:** Canadian Business Registry — the registered office address for EBX Technologies Ltd.:

```
EBX TECHNOLOGIES LTD.
1247 PHOENIX STREET, SUITE 301
VANCOUVER, BC V6B 1A1
Canada
```

Note the street name: **Phoenix** Street — the same word embedded in the marketplace name (`Digital Phoenix`) and the forum handle (`alex_phoenix_crypto`). A recurring motif the actor was evidently attached to, which made cross-platform attribution straightforward.

