## Tools & Methodology

| Tool / Platform | Use |
|---|---|
| CryptoTalk forum | Seed username + email harvest |
| TechHelp Q&A | SSH config / infrastructure leak |
| LinkedOut | Real name → company pivot |
| Canadian Business Registry | Company → director real name + address |
| Sherlock / WhatsMyName | Username enumeration across platforms |

### General OSINT Pivot Order
1. **Seed** — any username, email, or alias
2. **Enumerate** — find all accounts using that seed (Sherlock, WhatsMyName)
3. **Harvest** — extract emails, phone numbers, company names from profiles
4. **Pivot** — use harvested data as new seeds (email → business registry → real name)
5. **Verify** — cross-reference across at least 2 independent sources before attributing

